  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation:\n\n25 * 5 * 10 * 2 * 4 * 21\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ce560fc547581d91aa28575855976ce48f25a7f9beb85626def585a18220f09c.png] \n\nApplying each option to the given equation:\n\nOption 1) –, +, ÷, ×, = \n\n25 - 5 + __10 ÷ 2__ × 4 = 21\n\n25 - 5 + __5 ×____ 4__ = 21\n\n__25__ - 5 __+ 20__ = 21\n\n__45 - 5__ = 21\n\n40 ≠ 21 \n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 2) ÷, ×, +, –, = \n__25 ÷ 5__ × 10 + 2 - 4 = 21\n__5 × ____10__ + 2 - 4 = 21\n__50 + 2__ - 4 = 21\n__52 -____ 4__ = 21\n48 ≠ 21 \nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ×, ÷, –, +, =\n25 × __5 ÷ 10__ - 2 + 4 = 21\n__25 ×____ 0.5__ - 2 + 4 = 21\n__12.5 __- 2 __+____ 4__ = 21\n__16.5 - 2 __= 21\n14.5 ≠ 21 \nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷, +, ×, –, = \n__25 ÷ 5__ + 10 × 2 - 4 = 21\n5 + __10 ____× 2__ - 4 = 21\n__5 + 20__ - 4 = 21\n\n__25 - 4__ = 21 \n21 = 21 \nLHS = RHS\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4).**",
